<main class="page__body"><!--[--><!--[--><div class="hero hero--loaded" style="--bg-enter-delay:1.4s;"><div class="hero__bg"><img width="1920" height="1236" data-nuxt-img="" sizes="(max-width: 639px) 200vw, (max-width: 1279px) 100vw, (max-width: 1349px) 100vw, 1920px" srcset="/assets/img/794ab0df2a96-implants-hero-bg.avif 640w, /assets/img/53b6c1932593-implants-hero-bg.avif 1280w, /assets/img/caa926a32a57-implants-hero-bg.avif 1920w, /assets/img/8af8c1727ac2-implants-hero-bg.avif 2560w, /assets/img/89df6ea06f62-implants-hero-bg.avif 3840w" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image image--loaded hero__image" alt="" fetchpriority="high" src="/assets/img/89df6ea06f62-implants-hero-bg.avif"></div><div class="hero__content"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="hero-content-grid"><div class="hero-content-grid__item hero-content-grid__item--header"><h1 class="hero__title u-text-headings-medium" style="max-width: 378px;"><span class="word" aria-hidden="true" style="display: inline-block;">Dental</span> <span class="word" aria-hidden="true" style="display: inline-block;">implants</span><span class="sr-only" style="position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0px; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0px, 0px, 0px, 0px); white-space: nowrap; border: 0px;">Dental implants</span></h1></div><div class="hero-content-grid__item hero-content-grid__item--body"><div class="video-dialog video-dialog--type-inline hero__video-preview"><video class="video-dialog__preview" width="250" height="445" muted="" loop="" playsinline="" src="/cms/api/media/file/implants-hero-tease.webm" autoplay=""></video><button aria-label="Play video" class="video-dialog__button"><div class="icon-button icon-button--type-primary icon-button--size-medium video-dialog__play-button"><div class="icon-button__icon"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="54" height="54" viewBox="0 0 54 54"><path fill="currentColor" d="M22.031 19.687a1 1 0 0 1 1.515-.858l12.188 7.313a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.715L23.546 35.17a1 1 0 0 1-1.515-.857V19.687Z"></path></svg><!--]--></div></div></button><!--teleport start--><!--teleport end--></div></div><div class="hero-content-grid__item hero-content-grid__item--footer"><div class="hero__body u-text-body-large"><!--[--><div><p>Replace missing teeth with dental implants</p>
</div><!--]--></div><div class="hero__cta"><!--[--><button class="button button--type-primary button--icon-end"><div class="button__text u-text-body-button"><!--[-->Book a visit<!--]--></div><!----></button><!--]--></div></div></div><!--]--></div></div></div><!--]--><!--]--><div class="page__sections"><!--[-->
<section id="about" class="section-service" style="view-timeline:--tl-section-about;"><!--[--><div class="service-about u-bg-primary implants-page__about"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="scroll-block"><div class="scroll-block__overlay"></div><div class="scroll-block__content scroll-block-grid"><div class="scroll-block-grid__header"><div class="scroll-block-progress"><div class="scroll-block-progress__fill"></div></div><h2 class="scroll-block__title u-text-headings-medium">About dental implants</h2></div><div class="scroll-block-grid__body"><div class="scroll-block__items"><!--[--><div class="scroll-block-item"><div class="scroll-block-item__header"><h3 class="scroll-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">What is a dental implant?</h3><!----></div><div class="scroll-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">– A dental implant is a titanium screw that is inserted into the jawbone and a dental crown is created above the gum.</div></div><div class="scroll-block-item"><div class="scroll-block-item__header"><h3 class="scroll-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">Fully restores the function and aesthetics of a natural tooth</h3><!----></div><div class="scroll-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">– A modern way to restore one or more missing teeth.</div></div><div class="scroll-block-item"><div class="scroll-block-item__header"><h3 class="scroll-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">Helps to restore a complete bite</h3><!----></div><div class="scroll-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">– Dental implants can not only restore chewing function, but also natural facial contours and clear speech.</div></div><div class="scroll-block-item"><div class="scroll-block-item__header"><h3 class="scroll-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">A long-lasting solution</h3><!----></div><div class="scroll-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">– We use the Swiss implant system Straumann, whose implants have a lifetime warranty.</div></div><!--]--></div></div></div></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="service-when u-bg-primary implants-page__when"><div class="list-block list-block--visible"><div class="list-block__header u-bg-primary"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><h2 class="list-block__title u-text-headings-large">In what situations are implants necessary?</h2><div class="list-block__header-photos"><!--[--><img width="630" height="410" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/077f4340d011-9.avif 1x, /assets/img/167ca47c21cc-9.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" alt="" class="list-block__header-photo" style="--delay:0s;" src="/assets/img/077f4340d011-9.avif"><img width="630" height="410" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/1383daa47e8e-10.avif 1x, /assets/img/b218d503c109-10.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" alt="" class="list-block__header-photo" style="--delay:0.2s;" src="/assets/img/1383daa47e8e-10.avif"><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="list-block__body u-bg-secondary"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><ul class="list-block__items"><!--[--><li class="list-block-item" style="--delay:0.4s;"><div class="list-block-item__aside"><span class="list-block-item__number u-text-body-large">01</span></div><div class="list-block-item__body"><h3 class="list-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">One tooth is missing.</h3><div class="list-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">It is replaced with an implant.</div></div></li><li class="list-block-item" style="--delay:0.6000000000000001s;"><div class="list-block-item__aside"><span class="list-block-item__number u-text-body-large">02</span></div><div class="list-block-item__body"><h3 class="list-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">Several adjacent teeth are missing.</h3><div class="list-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">Non-removable bridges are created on implants.</div></div></li><li class="list-block-item" style="--delay:0.8s;"><div class="list-block-item__aside"><span class="list-block-item__number u-text-body-large">03</span></div><div class="list-block-item__body"><h3 class="list-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">All teeth in the upper/lower jaw are missing.</h3><div class="list-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">Complete implant-based restoration of teeth</div></div></li><!--]--></ul><!--]--></div></div></div></div><div class="service-efficiency u-bg-secondary implants-page__efficiency"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="service-efficiency__header"><h2 class="section-title u-text-headings-large"><!--[-->How is an implant inserted?<!--]--></h2></div><div class="service-efficiency__body"><div class="image-info-box"><div class="image-info-box__item image-info-box__item--aside"><!--[--><img width="410" height="588" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/6bc9b0c2f605-5.avif 1x, /assets/img/6a9371b2e69f-5.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image image--loaded image-info-box__image image-info-box__image--visible" alt="Service Efficiency" loading="lazy" src="/assets/img/6bc9b0c2f605-5.avif"><!--]--></div><div class="image-info-box__item image-info-box__item--main"><div class="scroll-box"><div class="vertical-scroll-progress-bar vertical-scroll-progress-bar--theme-primary scroll-box__progress-bar"></div><div class="scroll-box__header"><p class="u-text-body-large">1. An implant screw is placed in the jawbone after which the wound heals.<br>
2. After about 3 months, once the implant has fully healed, the dental crown is applied.<br>
3. The missing tooth is fully restored — both functional and aesthetic improvements are achieved,</p><!----></div><div class="scroll-box__body"><!--[--><!--]--></div></div></div><div class="image-info-box__item image-info-box__item--footer"><!--[--><button class="button button--type-secondary button--icon-end"><div class="button__text u-text-body-button"><!--[-->Book a visit<!--]--></div><!----></button><!--]--></div></div></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="overlay-section"><!--[--><div class="service-how u-bg-primary implants-page__how"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="service-how-grid"><div class="service-how-grid__item service-how-grid__item--header"><h2 class="section-title u-text-headings-large"><!--[-->How does the treatment process work?<!--]--></h2></div><div class="service-how-grid__item service-how-grid__item--body"><div class="vertical-scroll-progress-bar vertical-scroll-progress-bar--theme-secondary service-how__progress"></div><div class="service-how__items"><!--[--><div class="service-how-item"><div class="service-how-item-grid"><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--aside"><img width="410" height="588" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/76ad0630c3ea-17.avif 1x, /assets/img/b0fb2c290012-17.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" alt="" loading="lazy" class="service-how-item__image" src="/assets/img/76ad0630c3ea-17.avif"></div><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--main"><div class="service-how-item__body"><div class="service-how-item__html u-wysiwyg"><h3>1. First appointment — Examinations</h3>
<p>During the first visit, the doctor will perform the necessary examinations:<br>
– digital teeth scanning with a 3Shape scanner<br>
– digital dental X-rays<br>
– detailed examination of the oral cavity and teeth<br>
– professional facial photographs for smile analysis</p>
<p>Based on this information, a personalised treatment plan will be created.</p>
</div><!----></div></div></div></div><div class="service-how-item"><div class="service-how-item-grid"><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--aside"><img width="410" height="588" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/06303da2ef84-18.avif 1x, /assets/img/86b65b4e1244-18.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" alt="" loading="lazy" class="service-how-item__image" src="/assets/img/06303da2ef84-18.avif"></div><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--main"><div class="service-how-item__body"><div class="service-how-item__html u-wysiwyg"><h3>2. Second appointment — Presentation of the treatment plan</h3>
<p>Based on the examinations of the first visit, a personalised treatment plan is prepared for you with further treatment steps, clear costs, timelines, which includes not only veneer planning, but a complete plan on how you can achieve your perfect smile. The doctor will also digitally create your future smile design (DSD).</p>
</div><!----></div></div></div></div><div class="service-how-item"><div class="service-how-item-grid"><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--aside"><img width="410" height="588" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/ecdb95ca5d34-19.avif 1x, /assets/img/654bfacba341-19.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" alt="" loading="lazy" class="service-how-item__image" src="/assets/img/ecdb95ca5d34-19.avif"></div><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--main"><div class="service-how-item__body"><div class="service-how-item__html u-wysiwyg"><h3>3. Dental implant placement and healing</h3>
<p>If your jawbone volume is sufficient for an implant placement procedure without bone augmentation, during a single visit, the surgeon will place the implant in place of the missing tooth. This procedure is quick (up to 1 hour) and painless, as anaesthesia is used. It is also possible to perform sedation with laughing gas for maximum relaxation. On average, the implant takes three months to settle in.</p>
</div><!----></div></div></div></div><div class="service-how-item"><div class="service-how-item-grid"><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--aside"><img width="410" height="588" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/541045d69bb8-20.avif 1x, /assets/img/c76d88a4356e-20.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" alt="" loading="lazy" class="service-how-item__image" src="/assets/img/541045d69bb8-20.avif"></div><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--main"><div class="service-how-item__body"><div class="service-how-item__html u-wysiwyg"><h3>4. Implant-supported prosthetics (dental crown)</h3>
<p>After three months, when the implant has healed, a dental crown is installed, which visually and functionally replaces a natural tooth.</p>
</div><!----></div></div></div></div><!--]--></div></div><!----></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="service-price u-bg-primary implants-page__price"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="callout u-bg-secondary apply-callout"><div class="callout__body"><!--[--><!--[--><h2 class="u-text-headings-small service-price__title">Comprehensive diagnostics price today</h2><p class="u-text-body-medium">After the diagnosis, you will receive a personalised treatment plan, including not only the planning of the aligners, but also other required procedures for obtaining your perfect smile.</p><!--]--><!--]--></div><div class="callout__aside"><!--[--><!--[--><div class="service-price__prices"><span class="service-price__price service-price__price--old u-text-headings-small">€650</span><span class="service-price__price service-price__price--new u-text-headings-medium">€280</span></div><!--]--><!--]--></div><div class="callout__cta"><!--[--><button class="button button--type-secondary button--icon-end"><div class="button__text u-text-body-button"><!--[-->Book a visit<!--]--></div><!----></button><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div><!--]--></section>
<section id="portfolio" style="view-timeline:--tl-section-portfolio;"><!--[--><div class="overlay-section"><!--[-->
<section class="section-portfolio"><div class="portfolio-story u-bg-tertiary section-portfolio__story"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="portfolio-story__header"><h2 class="section-title u-text-headings-large"><!--[-->Our patient’s story on the way to the Perfect Smile<!--]--></h2></div><div class="portfolio-story__body"><div class="portfolio-story-box u-bg-secondary"><div class="portfolio-story-box__aside"><div class="video-dialog video-dialog--type-cover portfolio-story-box__preview"><video class="video-dialog__preview" width="640" height="1138" muted="" loop="" playsinline="" src="/cms/api/media/file/sales-story-tease.webm" autoplay=""></video><button aria-label="Play video" class="video-dialog__button"><div class="icon-button icon-button--type-primary icon-button--size-medium video-dialog__play-button"><div class="icon-button__icon"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="54" height="54" viewBox="0 0 54 54"><path fill="currentColor" d="M22.031 19.687a1 1 0 0 1 1.515-.858l12.188 7.313a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.715L23.546 35.17a1 1 0 0 1-1.515-.857V19.687Z"></path></svg><!--]--></div></div></button><!--teleport start--><!--teleport end--></div></div><div class="portfolio-story-box__body"><div class="u-wysiwyg"><h3>Goal</h3>
<p>To improve the appearance of my smile, I was concerned about the existing composite coatings on the front teeth (fillings), which were worn, cracked, and discoloured.</p>
<h3>What we did</h3>
<ul>
<li>We performed comprehensive diagnostics – collecting the patient’s history, followed by oral cavity and teeth examination, 3 Shape scan, intraoral digital X-rays, KSDT (3D X-ray), photo protocol, facial analysis;</li>
<li>We prepared a personalised treatment plan, including all the required finances, implementation time, and also demonstrated a digital smile design, during which the patient was able to view before/after pictures of her smile before we started any treatment process.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Result</h3>
<p>Treatment duration 3 months:</p>
<ul>
<li>We replaced 2 missing teeth with Straumann implants,</li>
<li>We performed endodontic root canal treatment under microscope control, therapeutic treatment and smile reconstruction with 24 ceramic veneers, which were made in our technical laboratory in Dubai.</li>
</ul>
</div></div></div></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="portfolio-examples u-bg-tertiary section-portfolio__examples"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="portfolio-examples__header"><h2 class="section-title u-text-headings-large"><!--[-->Examples of our work<!--]--></h2></div><div class="portfolio-examples__body"><div class="portfolio-examples-list"><!--[--><div class="portfolio-examples-item portfolio-examples-list__item"><div class="portfolio-examples-item__media"><div class="portfolio-examples-item__media-container"><!--[--><div class="media-item portfolio-examples-item__media-item" style="" id="69de08b7f841083f846dc926"><div><div id="tperxesce" class="vci--container media-item__asset media-item__asset--comparison" tabindex="0" data-testid="vci-container" style="display: flex; height: 344.118px;"><img class="vci--right-image" data-testid="right-image" src="/cms/api/media/file/Alberts1pēc-680x450.avif" style="clip-path: inset(0px 0px 0px 260px);"><img class="vci--left-image" data-testid="left-image" src="/cms/api/media/file/Alberts1pirms-680x450.avif" style="clip-path: inset(0px 260px 0px 0px);"><div class="vci--slider" style="cursor: ew-resize !important; flex-direction: column; height: 100%; left: 240px; top: 0px; width: 40px;"><div class="vci--slider-line" style="background: rgb(3, 28, 20); height: 100%; width: 2px;"></div><div class="vci--custom-handle">
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="60" height="60" viewBox="0 0 60 60">
      <circle cx="30" cy="30" r="29.5" fill="#031C14" stroke="#031C14"></circle>
      <path fill="none" stroke="#DDEFDE" stroke-width="2" d="M17 30.5h26m-26 0 4.645-4.5M17 30.5l4.645 4.5M43 30.5 38.355 26M43 30.5 38.355 35"></path>
    </svg>
  </div><div class="vci--slider-line" style="background: rgb(3, 28, 20); height: 100%; width: 2px;"></div></div><!----><!----></div></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><div class="portfolio-examples-item__content"><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><h3><strong>Full smile reconstruction</strong></h3><p>In this clinical case, the patient came to us with a serious problem – he had only six teeth left in both the upper and lower jaws. He wanted not only to restore his teeth, but also to regain a full, harmonious and natural smile that would give him confidence and look truly inspiring.</p><h3><strong>Planning and functional reconstruction</strong></h3><p>Our team started treatment with a comprehensive approach – we carefully planned each stage of the treatment in order to restore both the patient's aesthetic appearance and full chewing function.&nbsp;</p><p>To replace his missing teeth, we inserted twelve Swiss <strong>Straumann</strong> implants – six in the upper and lower jaws in the lateral teeth areas. These implants provided a stable foundation for zirconia crowns.</p><h3><strong>Aesthetic art</strong></h3><p>On the patient's remaining teeth, we installed exclusive ceramic veneers hand-made by our cooperation partners – professional ceramic specialists in Dubai. Each veneer was custom-made to complement the patient's facial proportions, smile line and speech characteristics.</p><p>The ultra-thin ceramic layer of just 0.5&nbsp;mm made it possible to preserve natural translucency and light reflection, thus creating an outstanding aesthetic appearance with no plastic or artificial feeling.</p><h3><strong>Perfection in the details</strong></h3><p>Zirconia crowns on implants ensured the durability and longevity of the structure, while veneers gave the patient's smile a look of lightness, radiance and sophistication.&nbsp;</p><p>The whole treatment process – from insertion of implants through to final prosthetics – lasted seven months. The aesthetic stage with the production and installation of veneers took about four weeks.&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Result</strong></h3><p>The result is not just a new smile – it is a story of complete transformation. The patient acquired a healthy, harmonious and natural smile, which not only restored his chewing function, but also reflected his self-confidence, inner strength and improved quality of life.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="portfolio-examples-item portfolio-examples-list__item"><div class="portfolio-examples-item__media"><div class="portfolio-examples-item__media-container"><!--[--><div class="media-item portfolio-examples-item__media-item" style="" id="69de08c2f841083f846dc927"><div><div id="lhmodyfd9" class="vci--container media-item__asset media-item__asset--comparison" tabindex="0" data-testid="vci-container" style="display: flex; height: 344.118px;"><img class="vci--right-image" data-testid="right-image" src="/cms/api/media/file/1pēc-2-680x450.avif" style="clip-path: inset(0px 0px 0px 260px);"><img class="vci--left-image" data-testid="left-image" src="/cms/api/media/file/1pirms-3-680x450.avif" style="clip-path: inset(0px 260px 0px 0px);"><div class="vci--slider" style="cursor: ew-resize !important; flex-direction: column; height: 100%; left: 240px; top: 0px; width: 40px;"><div class="vci--slider-line" style="background: rgb(3, 28, 20); height: 100%; width: 2px;"></div><div class="vci--custom-handle">
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="60" height="60" viewBox="0 0 60 60">
      <circle cx="30" cy="30" r="29.5" fill="#031C14" stroke="#031C14"></circle>
      <path fill="none" stroke="#DDEFDE" stroke-width="2" d="M17 30.5h26m-26 0 4.645-4.5M17 30.5l4.645 4.5M43 30.5 38.355 26M43 30.5 38.355 35"></path>
    </svg>
  </div><div class="vci--slider-line" style="background: rgb(3, 28, 20); height: 100%; width: 2px;"></div></div><!----><!----></div></div></div><div class="media-item portfolio-examples-item__media-item" style="display:none;" id="69de08c2f841083f846dc928"><img width="960" height="635" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/cms/api/media/file/rentgens pēc-960x635.avif 1x, /cms/api/media/file/rentgens pēc-960x635.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image media-item__asset" alt="" loading="lazy" src="/cms/api/media/file/rentgens pēc-960x635.avif"></div><!--]--></div><div class="carousel-navigation portfolio-examples-item__navigation"><button class="carousel-navigation__button carousel-navigation__button--prev" disabled="" aria-label="Previous slide"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40"><path fill="#DDEFDE" d="M11.47 20.53a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.06l4.773-4.773a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 1.06L13.061 20l4.242 4.243a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 1.06zM28 20v.75H12v-1.5h16z"></path></svg></button><div class="carousel-navigation__counter u-text-body-medium"><span class="carousel-navigation__current">1</span><span class="carousel-navigation__separator">/</span><span class="carousel-navigation__total">2</span></div><button class="carousel-navigation__button carousel-navigation__button--next" aria-label="Next slide"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40"><path fill="#DDEFDE" d="M28.53 20.53a.75.75 0 0 0 0-1.06l-4.773-4.773a.75.75 0 0 0-1.06 1.06L26.939 20l-4.242 4.243a.75.75 0 0 0 1.06 1.06zM12 20v.75h16v-1.5H12z"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="portfolio-examples-item__content"><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><h2><strong>Clinical case: a smile in just one day</strong></h2><p>A patient came to us with severe periodontitis, a disease affecting gums and bone tissue. He had already lost most of his teeth, while the rest were in critical condition. This not only undermined the patient's health, it also affected his quality of life – he had trouble eating, speaking, and, needless to say, he was reluctant to smile.</p><h3><strong>Solution: All-on-X concept</strong></h3><p>To restore both functionality and aesthetics, we chose the modern <strong>All-on-X</strong> method using the <strong>Neodent Neoporos implant system</strong>. This approach makes it possible to insert implants and attach a temporary restoration to them in just one day – with no long wait times.</p><h3><strong>A smile in just one day</strong></h3><p>In one operation:</p><ul class="list-bullet"><li class="" style="" value="1">we removed all the patient's damaged teeth,</li><li class="" style="" value="2">inserted implants, and</li><li class="" style="" value="3">inserted a temporary fixed restoration, fastened right onto the implants.</li></ul><p>During the operation, the patient was under <strong>intravenous sedation</strong> – he fell asleep calmly and awoke with a new smile. No pain and no stress.</p><h3><strong>Permanent solution</strong></h3><p>After three months, when the implants had fully taken root, we replaced the temporary structure with a permanent one – zirconia teeth with a titanium base. This solution ensures longevity, durability and the most natural appearance possible.</p><h3><strong>Result</strong></h3><p>In just one day, the patient went from being in a critical situation to having a new smile and a entirely new quality of life. Now his smile is natural, functional and harmonious. But most importantly of all – the patient has regained his confidence, inner balance and happiness in communicating with others.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="portfolio-examples-item portfolio-examples-list__item"><div class="portfolio-examples-item__media"><div class="portfolio-examples-item__media-container"><!--[--><div class="media-item portfolio-examples-item__media-item" style="" id="69de08caf841083f846dc929"><div><div id="ckju6np0y" class="vci--container media-item__asset media-item__asset--comparison" tabindex="0" data-testid="vci-container" style="display: flex; height: 344.118px;"><img class="vci--right-image" data-testid="right-image" src="/cms/api/media/file/1pēc-3-680x450.avif" style="clip-path: inset(0px 0px 0px 260px);"><img class="vci--left-image" data-testid="left-image" src="/cms/api/media/file/1pirms-4-680x450.avif" style="clip-path: inset(0px 260px 0px 0px);"><div class="vci--slider" style="cursor: ew-resize !important; flex-direction: column; height: 100%; left: 240px; top: 0px; width: 40px;"><div class="vci--slider-line" style="background: rgb(3, 28, 20); height: 100%; width: 2px;"></div><div class="vci--custom-handle">
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="60" height="60" viewBox="0 0 60 60">
      <circle cx="30" cy="30" r="29.5" fill="#031C14" stroke="#031C14"></circle>
      <path fill="none" stroke="#DDEFDE" stroke-width="2" d="M17 30.5h26m-26 0 4.645-4.5M17 30.5l4.645 4.5M43 30.5 38.355 26M43 30.5 38.355 35"></path>
    </svg>
  </div><div class="vci--slider-line" style="background: rgb(3, 28, 20); height: 100%; width: 2px;"></div></div><!----><!----></div></div></div><div class="media-item portfolio-examples-item__media-item" style="display:none;" id="69de08caf841083f846dc92a"><img width="960" height="634" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/cms/api/media/file/rentgens-pirms-960x634.avif 1x, /cms/api/media/file/rentgens-pirms-960x634.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image media-item__asset" alt="" loading="lazy" src="/cms/api/media/file/rentgens-pirms-960x634.avif"></div><div class="media-item portfolio-examples-item__media-item" style="display:none;" id="69de08caf841083f846dc92b"><img width="960" height="635" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/cms/api/media/file/rentgens-pec-960x635.avif 1x, /cms/api/media/file/rentgens-pec-960x635.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image media-item__asset" alt="" loading="lazy" src="/cms/api/media/file/rentgens-pec-960x635.avif"></div><!--]--></div><div class="carousel-navigation portfolio-examples-item__navigation"><button class="carousel-navigation__button carousel-navigation__button--prev" disabled="" aria-label="Previous slide"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40"><path fill="#DDEFDE" d="M11.47 20.53a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.06l4.773-4.773a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 1.06L13.061 20l4.242 4.243a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 1.06zM28 20v.75H12v-1.5h16z"></path></svg></button><div class="carousel-navigation__counter u-text-body-medium"><span class="carousel-navigation__current">1</span><span class="carousel-navigation__separator">/</span><span class="carousel-navigation__total">3</span></div><button class="carousel-navigation__button carousel-navigation__button--next" aria-label="Next slide"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40"><path fill="#DDEFDE" d="M28.53 20.53a.75.75 0 0 0 0-1.06l-4.773-4.773a.75.75 0 0 0-1.06 1.06L26.939 20l-4.242 4.243a.75.75 0 0 0 1.06 1.06zM12 20v.75h16v-1.5H12z"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="portfolio-examples-item__content"><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><h2><strong>Clinical case: a new smile in just one day with the All-on-X method</strong></h2><p>A patient came to us with the dream of recovering her perfect smile and self-confidence. Thanks to the state-of-the-art <strong>All-on-X</strong> treatment method, this was possible in just one day.&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Essence of the method</strong></h3><p>All-on-X technology makes it possible to remove all damaged teeth in a single operation and immediately install a stable temporary prosthesis supported by implants. This approach is fast, functional and aesthetically appealing solution that enables the patient to go home the same day with a new smile.</p><h3><strong>Course of treatment</strong></h3><p>During the operation, implants were inserted into the patient's upper jaw, immediately followed by the installation of temporary structure made of <strong>PMMA </strong>(highly durable polymer) on them. After about three months of adaptation and healing, we replaced this temporary structure with a<strong> permanent zirconia prosthesis</strong> – a material that combines excellent aesthetics, durability and longevity.</p><h3><strong>Teamwork and patient comfort</strong></h3><p>The procedure was carried out under full anesthesia under the supervision of an experienced team of anesthesiologists, thus guaranteeing maximum safety and comfort for the patient.</p><p><br></p><p>The treatment was performed by an implant surgeon and a prosthodontist, whose precise teamwork ensured a foreseeable, high-quality, and aesthetically flawless outcome.</p></div></div></div></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="portfolio-examples__footer"><button class="button button--type-secondary button--icon-end"><div class="button__text u-text-body-button"><!--[-->Book a visit<!--]--></div><!----></button></div><!--]--></div></div></section><!--]--></div><!--]--></section><div class="overlay-section"><!--[-->
<section id="process" style="view-timeline:--tl-section-process;"><div class="process-team u-bg-secondary"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><!--[--><div class="process-team-block"><div class="process-team-block__header"><h2 class="section-title u-text-headings-large"><!--[-->First-time clients are received by<!--]--></h2></div><div class="process-team__body"><div class="process-team-member-grid"><!--[--><div class="process-team-member-grid__item process-team-member" style="--start-transform:translateY(20vmin);--end-transform:translateY(-20vmin);"><div class="process-team-member__header"><img width="680" height="850" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Dr_Aleksejevs_72dpi-680x850.avif 1x, /cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Dr_Aleksejevs_72dpi-680x850.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image image--loaded process-team-member__image" alt="Dr_Aleksejevs" loading="lazy" src="/cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Dr_Aleksejevs_72dpi-680x850.avif"></div><div class="process-team-member__info"><h3 class="process-team-member__name u-text-body-large">Dr. Vladislavs Aleksejevs</h3><div class="process-team-member__role u-text-body-xsmall">Clinic Head, Dentist</div><div class="process-team-member__description u-wysiwyg">Dr. Vladislavs&nbsp;worked in the field of dentistry since 2014. A graduate of Riga Stradiņš University's Faculty of Dentistry,&nbsp;he studied inorganic chemistry at Harvard University.&nbsp;In 2018, he founded LAVA dental practice in Ludza. Two years later, in 2020, he founded LAVA dental studio in Riga.&nbsp;He specialises in aesthetic, digital dentistry and smile makeovers using veneers and&nbsp;regularly attends conferences and training courses in Latvia and abroad.&nbsp;You can find out more about Dr. Vladislavs' accomplishments in dentistry and everyday life on his Instagram page: @dr.aleksejevs</div></div></div><div class="process-team-member-grid__item process-team-member" style="--start-transform:translateY(0);--end-transform:translateY(0);"><div class="process-team-member__header"><img width="680" height="850" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Dr_Skidans_72dpi-680x850.avif 1x, /cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Dr_Skidans_72dpi-680x850.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image image--loaded process-team-member__image" alt="Dr_Skidans" loading="lazy" src="/cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Dr_Skidans_72dpi-680x850.avif"></div><div class="process-team-member__info"><h3 class="process-team-member__name u-text-body-large">Dr. Miroslav Skidan</h3><div class="process-team-member__role u-text-body-xsmall">Dentist, Surgeon</div><div class="process-team-member__description u-wysiwyg">Dr. Miroslav&nbsp;has worked in the field of dentistry since 2010, specialising in surgery and implantology.&nbsp;After studying dentistry in Ukraine, he has worked as a dentist in Latvia for eight years.&nbsp;In 2019, he advanced his specialization as an implantologist in Porto, Portugal with the leading periodontist, implantologist Dr. Algridas Puišys in a 5-day practical training course.&nbsp;He trained with the maxillofacial surgeon Dr. Pedro Rodrigues in Braga, Portugal.&nbsp;All-on-4 implants or all on four is a prosthetics method that allows you to restore the entire row of teeth in one day, using only four implants.Regularly attends foreign courses and training in dentistry.</div></div></div><!--]--></div></div></div><div class="process-team-block"><div class="process-team-block__header"><h2 class="section-title u-text-headings-large"><!--[-->Our coordinators will take care of the treatment process<!--]--></h2></div><div class="process-team__body"><div class="process-team-member-grid"><!--[--><div class="process-team-member-grid__item process-team-member" style="--start-transform:translateY(20vmin);--end-transform:translateY(-20vmin);"><div class="process-team-member__header"><img width="680" height="850" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Elina_72dpi-680x850.avif 1x, /cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Elina_72dpi-680x850.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image image--loaded process-team-member__image" alt="Elina" loading="lazy" src="/cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Elina_72dpi-680x850.avif"></div><div class="process-team-member__info"><h3 class="process-team-member__name u-text-body-large">Elīna Volkova</h3><div class="process-team-member__role u-text-body-xsmall">Treatment Plan Coordinator</div><div class="process-team-member__description u-wysiwyg">A graduate of Riga's “Victoria” Vocational Secondary School, Elīna specialises in customer service and administrative work. Parallel to her job at LAVA Dental Studio, she is studying for a Bachelor’s degree in International Marketing and Sales Management, improving her knowledge in the field of communication and management.&nbsp;</div></div></div><div class="process-team-member-grid__item process-team-member" style="--start-transform:translateY(0);--end-transform:translateY(0);"><div class="process-team-member__header"><img width="680" height="850" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Viktorija_72dpi-680x850.avif 1x, /cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Viktorija_72dpi-680x850.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image image--loaded process-team-member__image" alt="Viktorija Griševa" loading="lazy" src="/cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Viktorija_72dpi-680x850.avif"></div><div class="process-team-member__info"><h3 class="process-team-member__name u-text-body-large">Viktorija Griševa</h3><div class="process-team-member__role u-text-body-xsmall">Administrator, Treatment Plans Coordinator&nbsp;</div><div class="process-team-member__description u-wysiwyg">At LAVA Dental Studio, Viktorija combines administrative duties with the role of treatment plan coordinator, helping patients to go through the entire treatment process step by step safely and confidently.&nbsp;
A balanced and internally strong personality, Viktorija remains calm in even the most difficult situations, invariably finding the most appropriate solution. She encourages patients and helps to coordinate the course of treatment in accordance with their wishes and means, ensuring that they have a well-planned and comfortable experience.&nbsp;</div></div></div><!--]--></div></div></div><!--]--><!--]--></div></div></section><!--]--></div><div class="overlay-section"><!--[-->
<section class="section-feedback" id="feedback" style="view-timeline:--tl-section-feedback;"><div class="feedback-reviews u-bg-primary section-feedback__reviews"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="feedback-reviews__header"><h2 class="section-title u-text-headings-large"><!--[-->Reviews<!--]--></h2></div><div class="feedback-reviews__body"><div class="feedback-reviews-box"><div class="feedback-reviews-box__content"><!--[--><div class="feedback-review-item" style=""><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>They use a modern and effective cleaning method,&nbsp;and my&nbsp;teeth&nbsp;now&nbsp;feel great.&nbsp;The option&nbsp;to choose additional services.&nbsp;I’d&nbsp;definitely recommend&nbsp;it!&nbsp;5/5 stars!</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Eduards</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>I&nbsp;visited&nbsp;this dental clinic for professional oral hygiene and was&nbsp;extremely satisfied.&nbsp;The staff&nbsp;are&nbsp;kind and&nbsp;helpful, the atmosphere is calm and pleasant.&nbsp;The hygienist worked very carefully and gently, explaining&nbsp;the whole process,&nbsp;and&nbsp;giving&nbsp;useful tips for oral health.After the&nbsp;treatment,&nbsp;my teeth became clean and fresh. It was a&nbsp;great&nbsp;feeling!&nbsp;I’d definitely recommend this clinic to anyone who wants high-quality&nbsp;and&nbsp;professional care.</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Jeļena Gžibovska</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>After my first visit to this clinic, I’m&nbsp;finally no&nbsp;longer&nbsp;scared of going to the dentist. Perfect!</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Monta Mineiķe</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>I visited Lava Dental Studio for a comprehensive diagnosis –&nbsp;it was&nbsp;a very professional and pleasant experience!&nbsp;From the&nbsp;very&nbsp;first moment I felt that I was in good hands – the staff were&nbsp;kind, explained&nbsp;everything&nbsp;clearly&nbsp;to me, and the examination was carried out carefully and with modern equipment.</p><p>I’m now&nbsp;waiting for&nbsp;my&nbsp;next&nbsp;appointment, when&nbsp;I’ll receive a personalised treatment plan, but I can already say –&nbsp;the&nbsp;level of service&nbsp;is very high&nbsp;and&nbsp;I get the&nbsp;feeling that they really care about each patient.</p><p>I definitely recommend&nbsp;them&nbsp;to anybody&nbsp;seeking&nbsp;high-quality dental services in Riga!</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Silvestrs Vaitkevics</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>I’m one of those people who WAS very&nbsp;scared&nbsp;of the dentist, because I have a panicky&nbsp;fear of needles and&nbsp;until now&nbsp;I’ve been fixing my teeth without anaesthesia for 19 years.&nbsp;An acquaintance&nbsp;recommended the Lava Dental Clinic to me.&nbsp;I researched it on the internet and&nbsp;concluded&nbsp;that I had to go for a consultation.&nbsp;When I&nbsp;got&nbsp;here, I&nbsp;received a very warm welcome.&nbsp;The girls on the staff are fantastic and very nice!&nbsp;Before&nbsp;my&nbsp;first&nbsp;appointment to correct&nbsp;my teeth,&nbsp;my insides were shaking, I felt as if&nbsp;I’d&nbsp;cry from fear, but before that I had to fill out a questionnaire with my wishes, where&nbsp;I&nbsp;mentioned that I’m paranoid about needles.&nbsp;I entered&nbsp;the office, lay down in fear and didn't even blink.&nbsp;But what surprised me was that, without my noticing, the dentist&nbsp;took the syringe and I didn't even feel that I was being injected.&nbsp;Of course,&nbsp;I shed a tear&nbsp;out&nbsp;of fear, but I&nbsp;needn’t have bothered, because&nbsp;there were no&nbsp;worries.&nbsp;I put on my headphones, choose my favourite Netflix series, and the&nbsp;dental treatment&nbsp;could&nbsp;begin!&nbsp;The best feeling, lying&nbsp;there for 2.5 hours,&nbsp;was that at some point you forget where you are, fall asleep,&nbsp;and&nbsp;at the same time you’re being taken care of with all the&nbsp;very latest&nbsp;modern innovations.&nbsp;The doctors do their job, I can even say, PERFECTLY, with care and love.&nbsp;Comparing&nbsp;my&nbsp;previous dental&nbsp;care&nbsp;and the appearance of&nbsp;my&nbsp;repaired teeth beforehand, the picture is&nbsp;akin to&nbsp;night and day!&nbsp;</p><p>I can definitely recommend this clinic and I’ll personally return here again and again whenever&nbsp;I need to&nbsp;in life.</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Madara Freiberga</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>The&nbsp;only dental clinic in my life that I’m&nbsp;happy to&nbsp;visit&nbsp;and spend money at!!&nbsp;[..]&nbsp;The&nbsp;staffare amazing!&nbsp;Incredibly nice people and professionals in their field!&nbsp;Words cannot describe it&nbsp;–&nbsp;you have to experience it, and I’m not afraid to recommend this dental clinic to anyone!&nbsp;</p><p>I wish you many productive years of work, dear Lava&nbsp;dental&nbsp;studio!</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Dace Krūziņa</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>The&nbsp;very&nbsp;best place to get your teeth cleaned, the service and&nbsp;welcome&nbsp;are top&nbsp;class. Thank you!!!</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Kristīne Kažoka</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>A very calm and pleasant atmosphere.&nbsp;I felt&nbsp;as if I was&nbsp;in safe hands.&nbsp;Everything&nbsp;wasexplained&nbsp;to me,&nbsp;helping me&nbsp;to understand every detail of the treatment plan!</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Lāsma Brenča</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Definitely the TOP clinic in Riga!!! I’d like to thank Dr. Vladislavs for&nbsp;a comprehensive&nbsp;visit, I’ll continue my treatment according to the&nbsp;prepared&nbsp;plan.</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Deniss Rimavcevs</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>A friendly welcome upon arrival, which already&nbsp;leaves&nbsp;you feeling&nbsp;cared&nbsp;for.&nbsp;Punctual appointment, which you’re&nbsp;always reminded&nbsp;about, if possible, offers different times for maintenance (which I really like).&nbsp;The doctors are competent,&nbsp;advise you on the best treatment plan and recommend what’s suitable or not&nbsp;for me.&nbsp;My favourite part&nbsp;is the&nbsp;headphones&nbsp;–&nbsp;I don't have to listen to&nbsp;my teeth&nbsp;being fixed, I&nbsp;just&nbsp;watch "FRIENDS" and sometimes&nbsp;even&nbsp;forget where I am.</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Toms Talle</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Wonderful&nbsp;service and&nbsp;fantastic&nbsp;specialists!&nbsp;Surgeon Miroslav extracted my&nbsp;wisdom teeth very quickly, skilfully and painlessly.</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Dāvis Uļģis</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Very pleasant service and professional doctors!&nbsp;I can 100% recommend Dr. Miroslav,&nbsp;mywisdom teeth surgery was very successful, painless&nbsp;with a fast&nbsp;rehabilitation process.&nbsp;Every&nbsp;visit&nbsp;I&nbsp;make&nbsp;is&nbsp;easy&nbsp;and stress-free.&nbsp;Thank you!</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Evelina Avlasina</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Entering LAVA, the atmosphere was&nbsp;hard to put into words.&nbsp;From the smell, to the interior and the staff.&nbsp;I’d like to say a special thank you to hygienist Diāna Zamarina for&nbsp;her wonderful&nbsp;communication, and&nbsp;for doing an&nbsp;even better job!&nbsp;I’ll definitely&nbsp;return&nbsp;and recommend it!!!</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Elina Vasiljeva</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Very good dentists,&nbsp;who&nbsp;explain everything. No&nbsp;pain, no fear, everything’s comfortable and convenient, so much so that I could fall asleep in the dentist's chair!</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Vitālijs Meija</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Extremely&nbsp;kind and pleasant service, friendly staff.&nbsp;Result and atmosphere 10/10,&nbsp;delighted&nbsp;to&nbsp;make return visits.&nbsp;Highly recommended!</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Veronika Šteņa</div></div><!--]--></div><div class="feedback-reviews-box__footer"><div class="carousel-autoplay carousel-autoplay--paused" style="--autoplay-item-duration:5000ms;"><button class="carousel-autoplay__button" aria-label="Play carousel"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40"><g><path fill="currentColor" d="M16 14.741a1 1 0 0 1 1.504-.864l9.015 5.26a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.727l-9.015 5.259A1 1 0 0 1 16 25.259z"></path></g></svg></button><div class="carousel-autoplay__dots"><!--[--><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot--active carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 1"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 2"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 3"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 4"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 5"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 6"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 7"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 8"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 9"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 10"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 11"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 12"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 13"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 14"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 15"></button><!--]--></div></div></div></div></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="feedback-instagram u-bg-primary section-feedback__instagram"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="feedback-instagram__header"><h2 class="section-titl